{"4122180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Truck Company", "steam_appid": 4122180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck Company is a real-time strategy game in which you and other players strive to gain the widest possible market share for your orders. You start by purchasing your first vehicle and searching for the most profitable orders for it, ensuring your truck operates 24/7 without wasting time on free flights. You also need to take care of your drivers, as a well-rested and experienced driver is key to ensuring your truck completes its tasks quickly and efficiently. Trucks require repairs over time, otherwise their speed decreases. Later, once you earn more money, you can build bus stations or shops to which you will have to deliver goods, either by purchasing them in advance or by producing them in your own factories. The direction of your company depends on you. The game is based on a natural system of supply and demand, so other players influence the profits you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who join companies participate in seasonal rankings, at the end of which they receive rewards that help them develop their business. The company offers a wide range of tasks to complete, as well as bonuses that will help you increase your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cars you start with date back to the 1950s. As technology advances, you'll gain access to more modern trucks with better performance. You can combine vehicles into convoys, making managing a large fleet a breeze. Cars have a wide range of modifications, but you'll first need to earn points to upgrade them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truck Company is a real-time strategy game in which you and other players strive to gain the widest possible market share for your orders. You start by purchasing your first vehicle and searching for the most profitable orders for it, ensuring your truck operates 24/7 without wasting time on free flights. You also need to take care of your drivers, as a well-rested and experienced driver is key to ensuring your truck completes its tasks quickly and efficiently. Trucks require repairs over time, otherwise their speed decreases. Later, once you earn more money, you can build bus stations or shops to which you will have to deliver goods, either by purchasing them in advance or by producing them in your own factories. The direction of your company depends on you. The game is based on a natural system of supply and demand, so other players influence the profits you earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who join companies participate in seasonal rankings, at the end of which they receive rewards that help them develop their business. The company offers a wide range of tasks to complete, as well as bonuses that will help you increase your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cars you start with date back to the 1950s. As technology advances, you'll gain access to more modern trucks with better performance. You can combine vehicles into convoys, making managing a large fleet a breeze. Cars have a wide range of modifications, but you'll first need to earn points to upgrade them.</p>", "short_description": "TruckCompany - is a strategic game in which you develop your transport enterprise, the aim of which is to create a great consortium with other players and compete with others for the title of the best businessmen", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Swedish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122180/5e428a22bcf4be4e40a53442ecbca05b2caba189/header.jpg?t=1777019033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122180/d2e551a356dddb264daf91d2ec5627ea1bd8807c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777019033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://s